  "content": "I cannot directly access Turo sync diagnostics or error logs from Drive247, so I cannot give a precise technical reason why three bookings were skipped last night.\n\nHowever, common reasons for sync skips include:\n1. **Booking already exists in Drive247** – Sync avoids creating duplicates.\n2. **Status not eligible** – Only active/confirmed bookings (not cancelled/pending/draft) are usually synced.\n3. **Missing or mismatched car mapping** – If the Turo car isn't mapped to a Drive247 vehicle, those bookings are skipped.\n4. **Temporary integration/authentication issues**.\n\nTo review specific skips, please share the booking numbers, car details, or any error message you saw. For a full technical investigation, I can offer to contact support.",
